2026-07-26T10:39:30.3366689Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3367489Z i /tmp/RtmpPi5Rp7/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3367978Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3368531Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3369529Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3370436Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3371619Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3372471Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3633387Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:39:30.3757174Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:39:30.4224760Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:39:30.4405593Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
